mit and Entire checkpoint context, creates an isolated workspace, runs deployment checks in Cloudflare Sandbox, and then creates a non-mutating review report. The CLI streams progress in real time and returns a report URL when complete. Review output includes findings, severity, and provenance so you can understand both what changed and why the review reached its recommendation.\n63: \n64: ## Self-hosting\n65: \n66: Nimbus supports hosted usage and self-hosted worker deployments. For setup steps, runtime requirements, and local dev workflow, see `docs/development.md`.\n67: \n68: ## License\n69: \n70: MIT\n\n(End of file - total 70 lines)\n</content>",
